  "take": "c4034574-c73fe8f5.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "c603c266",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "No bars. There’s never any bars in the walk-in. Somebody call. Somebody, please.",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "c603c266-ce6ab522.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "f7d12929",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "He’s breathing. They’re all breathing. They’re just… out.",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "f7d12929-9dd5e76b.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "26a88f6c",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "The garage door. Somebody’s in the garage.",
  "exaggeration": 0.85,
  "cfg": 0.38,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "26a88f6c-edc69f31.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "5f918941",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Is that… a card? He’s opening the lock.",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "5f918941-8301d6cf.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "a924fdf3",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "He’s going back for them. I have to get out. I have to get help.",
  "exaggeration": 1.0,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "a924fdf3-f558c597.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "b14b5cbc",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Dad picked the one where she’s smiling. She hated this picture. Said it made her look tired.",
  "exaggeration": 0.55,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "b14b5cbc-a2fbea96.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "8a0d77a0",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "He keeps touching his allergy bracelet. He’s done that since the hospital.",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "8a0d77a0-f7b5abf2.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "9610a2f1",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Grandpa keeps flipping his phone face down. Who texts him this late, the night of a funeral?",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "9610a2f1-718ef2d5.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "178b5333",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "New watch. Gold. Last month he was begging Mom for money.",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "178b5333-2746dfad.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "5058dbfb",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Forty people signed it. I didn’t know half of them.",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "5058dbfb-13f683c7.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "60851fdc",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "I can’t leave them like this. I need my phone. I need help.",
  "exaggeration": 0.8,
  "cfg": 0.38,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "60851fdc-ddd95aca.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "5872b106",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Dead. No dial tone. He cut it.",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "5872b106-7255a1da.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "fcef735a",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Grandpa’s old landline. Nobody uses it.",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "fcef735a-053a4fe6.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "9f2c8e0f",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Every switch is off, and the handle’s snapped. He broke it.",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "9f2c8e0f-25427d6f.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "3526df09",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "The breaker box. Dad’s always flipping these.",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "3526df09-68c518bd.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "5b6e9d44",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Alex’s drawing from third grade. And the funeral program, under the magnets. Somebody put it there like it was a report card.",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "5b6e9d44-de5ce1d8.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "a69d7e52",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "I’m fine.",
  "exaggeration": 0.45,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "a69d7e52-93c1471b.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "d409e6c4",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "No. Are you?",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "d409e6c4-b2a5b9c7.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "a4122e65",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Mom would’ve hated this.",
  "exaggeration": 0.55,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "a4122e65-5678f4a7.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "272c6a05",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Sorry. My grandpa’s… a lot.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "272c6a05-96d3bdd0.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "69eaaee3",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "You’re really late, you know.",
  "exaggeration": 0.6,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "69eaaee3-9af835a3.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "fff0948b",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "I gotta go.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "fff0948b-6bc98498.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "54898be2",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "I’m not eating six-dollar pizza.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "54898be2-f932bed2.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "3edab7f0",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "I’m not hungry.",
  "exaggeration": 0.45,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "3edab7f0-1e7a2b8d.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "7810ed31",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "Take your break, Manny.",
  "exaggeration": 1.05,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "7810ed31-4d42946a.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "44416e08",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "Time for your performance review.",
  "exaggeration": 1.1,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "44416e08-32cf8537.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "8ac206e5",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "Keep the ovens on. Got a party coming.",
  "exaggeration": 1.1,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "8ac206e5-b1d3949e.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "ef3c7d0d",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "Hi. I’m inside.",
  "exaggeration": 1.05,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "ef3c7d0d-373bf1f4.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "9901de64",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "You wrote: late and cold. Driver didn’t say a word.",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "9901de64-b8fe0dca.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "edbd20ed",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "I’m saying a lot now.",
  "exaggeration": 0.75,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "edbd20ed-42746b8f.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "2cce2709",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "Please tell us what went wrong.",
  "exaggeration": 1.05,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "2cce2709-f5bd7612.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "969ae73e",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "There you are, Lucia.",
  "exaggeration": 1.05,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "969ae73e-6b09f0f3.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "8db4993d",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "Knock knock.",
  "exaggeration": 1.05,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "8db4993d-0c607702.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "e0df446f",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "I found your house. I’ll find you.",
  "exaggeration": 1.05,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "e0df446f-d6d1dec2.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "a061c243",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "Ding dong.",
  "exaggeration": 1.05,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "a061c243-6ff78010.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "84b8856e",
  "who": "toni",
  "text": "Your order is on its way.",
  "exaggeration": 1.0,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": "toon",
  "take": "84b8856e-4f2a6896.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "d0fb72fc",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Dad? What do we do?",
  "exaggeration": 0.8,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "d0fb72fc-be1034ef.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "3dda7873",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "I don’t know, mija. I don’t know. We stay calm, we do what he says, and I get you two out. Okay?",
  "exaggeration": 0.85,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "3dda7873-a82d3c2a.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "ed66cd5a",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "Lucia? Lucia! Mija, look at me!",
  "exaggeration": 1.2,
  "cfg": 0.3,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "ed66cd5a-fb72c302.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "190bd87d",
  "who": "alex",
  "text": "Dad? Where are we? Why is everything spinning?",
  "exaggeration": 1.0,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "190bd87d-1e33f2e3.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "174badbc",
  "who": "grandpa",
  "text": "What the hell is this? Who put a damn hat on me?",
  "exaggeration": 1.0,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "174badbc-7ac1cd58.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "d4d09af0",
  "who": "uncle",
  "text": "Hey! HEY! Whoever’s out there, open the door!",
  "exaggeration": 1.5,
  "cfg": 0.3,
  "fx": "shout",
  "take": "d4d09af0-1a7e09fd.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "52d6bb73",
  "who": "ruben",
  "text": "Why are there balloons? Nobody here has a birthday.",
  "exaggeration": 1.1,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "52d6bb73-96b243cd.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "abbc99aa",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "Okay, that’s it. Kids, up. We’re leaving—",
  "exaggeration": 1.2,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": "shout",
  "take": "abbc99aa-fe8030ea.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "2e16ea49",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Dad, stop! There’s wires. They go under all of us.",
  "exaggeration": 1.2,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "2e16ea49-b9879ac7.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "af176bed",
  "who": "uncle",
  "text": "Twelve pizzas? What is this, some prank show? Where’s the camera?",
  "exaggeration": 1.0,
  "cfg": 0.38,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "af176bed-ffaef57d.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "e2bae04d",
  "who": "ruben",
  "text": "No. No, no, no. That’s the mascot. From the sign outside.",
  "exaggeration": 1.1,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "e2bae04d-1fc0319d.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "70c8fc6a",
  "who": "grandpa",
  "text": "I know that walk. That’s the delivery boy. Forty minutes late, and the pizza was cold.",
  "exaggeration": 0.85,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "70c8fc6a-e0339bba.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "06b5a1ef",
  "who": "grandpa",
  "text": "This is about that damn rating, isn’t it? Lucia. What did you write about him?",
  "exaggeration": 1.05,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "06b5a1ef-9f0b7092.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "5686916c",
  "who": "grandpa",
  "text": "Oh, so now you listen to me? Now?",
  "exaggeration": 0.95,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "5686916c-8f8356a7.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "73c6daa7",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "Enough! Both of you, stop it.",
  "exaggeration": 1.1,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "73c6daa7-56b3cbe4.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "1557a964",
  "who": "uncle",
  "text": "Yeah? Go tell that to the psycho in the cheese suit.",
  "exaggeration": 0.85,
  "cfg": 0.42,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "1557a964-ec8ff853.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "8ba77637",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "No. Mija, no. Look at me. This is not on you, okay? It’s not.",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "8ba77637-dcf95818.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "337ed68e",
  "who": "grandpa",
  "text": "Nothing to say? Typical.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "337ed68e-0355084d.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "2f89f3ee",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "Alex. Alex, look at me. Whatever he brings you, you check it first. Every bite. No seeds, okay?",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.38,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "2f89f3ee-070e9a9b.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "24f8f6c9",
  "who": "alex",
  "text": "I know, Dad. I know. I’m not a baby.",
  "exaggeration": 0.85,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "24f8f6c9-d0613677.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "5be4e2e9",
  "who": "ruben",
  "text": "Okay. Horror movie rules. Rule one, never split up. Rule two… I don’t remember rule two.",
  "exaggeration": 1.0,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "5be4e2e9-dad27ac2.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "e0a2933b",
  "who": "uncle",
  "text": "Hey. What about her? Where’s hers?",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "e0a2933b-d382e4ea.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "d69b1127",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "...One star.",
  "exaggeration": 0.55,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "d69b1127-e3b0ae62.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "ee7e3934",
  "who": "alex",
  "text": "Lucia?",
  "exaggeration": 1.0,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "ee7e3934-141ff99c.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "b7856839",
  "who": "alex",
  "text": "Dad… there’s seeds. There’s seeds all over the crust—",
  "exaggeration": 1.4,
  "cfg": 0.3,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "b7856839-84d581ac.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "8c497494",
  "who": "alex",
  "text": "No seeds. Just pepperoni. Okay. Okay.",
  "exaggeration": 0.75,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "8c497494-9f52e6a3.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "37042294",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "Okay! Okay! Just eat around them, mijo. Slow. Eat around them.",
  "exaggeration": 1.3,
  "cfg": 0.3,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "37042294-fe96951f.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "efbceafe",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "Lucia, stop. Don’t. Don’t give him a reason.",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "efbceafe-f7f4b8d6.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "dc58b253",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "That’s it. That’s it, mijo. You’re okay. You’re okay.",
  "exaggeration": 0.95,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "dc58b253-15eed82d.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "4fa4cf10",
  "who": "dad",
  "text": "ALEX! His pen! His pen’s in his jacket! Let me get it, PLEASE—",
  "exaggeration": 1.9,
  "cfg": 0.25,
  "fx": "shout",
  "take": "4fa4cf10-a9eb775d.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "7a9a845a",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Sesame. He can’t even touch it. Last time, he ended up in the hospital.",
  "exaggeration": 0.65,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "7a9a845a-9c45545d.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "aa4c0d3c",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "Wires going under every chair. And it’s counting pizzas, not seconds. Oh my God.",
  "exaggeration": 0.85,
  "cfg": 0.4,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "aa4c0d3c-fdd145aa.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "8f599e58",
  "who": "lucia",
  "text": "“Ramirez, party of six,” with a smiley face. He made us a banner. That’s so messed up.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "8f599e58-b257d436.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "327a3a4c",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "Don’t look at them. Don’t.",
  "exaggeration": 0.85,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "327a3a4c-915032cc.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "4b608c02",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "They were alive at ten. I watched him do it through that little window. I just… watched.",
  "exaggeration": 0.9,
  "cfg": 0.35,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "4b608c02-49899068.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "1bbf68b5",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "“Toni’s Famous Seeds.” It’s just sesame. We put it on everything.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "1bbf68b5-dbe1a853.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "47b816bd",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "Can’t make it yet. Dough, sauce, cheese. Come on, Manny.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "47b816bd-9c57b5f6.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "e02019f8",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "Gotta cut it first. Eight slices.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "e02019f8-589c1291.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "f63fe1de",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "Nothing to send out yet.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "f63fe1de-5c669113.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "c80ac9c4",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "“World’s Best Boss.” Smashed in three pieces. Guess somebody disagreed.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "c80ac9c4-0fcd01a4.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "b61888dc",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "The boss’s lie detector. Bought it to catch whoever was skimming the register. Never caught anybody.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "b61888dc-ab69458f.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "0fc05a00",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "Padlocked. The tape says “Driver.” That’s his.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "0fc05a00-378015f4.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "94953072",
  "who": "manny",
  "text": "Eight slices, eight numbers. And I don’t have a single one.",
  "exaggeration": 0.7,
  "cfg": 0.45,
  "fx": null,
  "take": "94953072-8dafdd75.mp3"
 },
 {
  "key": "f8c1b814",
